# The build context of docker/Dockerfile is the repository root. Docker (BuildKit) reads THIS file -
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore, next to the Dockerfile - instead of a root .dockerignore. It is an allow-list: only the
# source folders the image ships are sent (never .git, .venv, warehouse/, runs/, secrets files or local notes).
*

!sources

**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
